  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Klaberjass. Logic: Two-player Jass game with unique trump ranking and meld scoring.',
    Player: "Klaberjass (also known as Clob, Bella, or Bela) is a quintessential two-player trick-taking game. Known for its complex trump ranking (Jack and Nine are most powerful) and the 'Bella' bonus.",
    objective: 'Score 500 points by winning tricks containing point cards and declaring melds.',
    gameplay: '1. Must follow suit. If unable, must trump if possible.\n2. **Bella**: Playing the King and Queen of trumps scores 20 points (must be announced).\n3. **Meld**: Sequences of 3 (20 pts) or 4 (50 pts) in the same suit score. Only the highest meld on either side scores for the team.\n4. **Last Trick**: 10 points.',
    keyRules: [
      'Trump ranking: Jack (20), Nine (14), Ace (11), Ten (10), King (4), Queen (3), Eight (0), Seven (0)',
      'Plain suit ranking: Ace (11), Ten (10), King (4), Queen (3), Jack (2), Nine (0), Eight (0), Seven (0)',
